														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1581813">
									

<ul>
<li>&quot;Class-2&quot; and &quot;Class-4&quot; are inconsistent with Foundation personnel classification. The containment procedures are also entirely too long.</li>
<li>Even in peer-reviewed scientific journals, you will see the common name of an animal in parentheses after the scientific name. I shouldn't have to Google Latin just to know you're talking about an antelope.</li>
<li>The Description is so choked full of technobabble and unnecessarily complicated language that I have <strong>absolutely no idea</strong> what your SCP does.</li>
<li>The collapsibles are <strong>extremely</strong> annoying. The article isn't long enough to merit them and they are fantastically annoying to a reader since clicking on them breaks your reading flow.</li>
</ul>
<p>You have been around chat long enough to know that you should have sandboxed this and gotten feedback beforehand. Downvoted.</p>

