			<div class="content" id="post-content-1581836">
									

<p>Hmm, when you showed me the original draft, I wasn't sure how soon you were gonna post this (sometimes just taking the leap is the fastest way to learn, though)&#8212; so I'll reiterate that it definitely needs more of a stylistic/grammar razor. Just take it sentence by sentence and simplify. It's far from incomprehensible, but it is definitely murky.</p>
<p>The final addendum is iffy, too, dialogue-wise&#8230; although I don't see why the collapsible formatting is a problem.</p>
<p>Issues aside, though, I do really like the cyclical zoological horror of this concept (even without the slightly sensational ending).</p>
<p><strong>Edit</strong>: aaand some of those edits already make a significant difference.</p>

